"ud6ce6193\" id=\"ud6ce6193\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b53a528\" id=\"u1b53a528\">Window - cmd：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%5Cnpyinstaller%20-n%20PID_Tool%20-i%20img%2Flogo.ico%20%5E%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--clean%20--onedir%5Ct%20%5E%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--add-data%3D%5C%22res%3Bres%5C%22%20%5E%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--add-data%3D%5C%22img%3Bimg%5C%22%20%5E%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--exclude-module%3D%5C%22matplotlib%5C%22%20%5E%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctapp.py%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22btSy1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u536ba4ed\" id=\"u536ba4ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"u49c66f26\" id=\"u49c66f26\">Linux/Mac：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%E6%88%90%E5%8D%95%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cnpyinstaller%20-n%20PID_Tool%20-i%20img%2Flogo.ico%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--clean%20--onefile%5Ct%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--add-data%3D%5C%22res%3Ares%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--add-data%3D%5C%22img%3Aimg%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct--exclude-module%3D%5C%22matplotlib%5C%22%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctmain.py%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Uh8Rr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"hBKLc\" id=\"hBKLc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5762dd81\" id=\"u5762dd81\">方式二：编写打包脚本</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u99987ae5\" id=\"u99987ae5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1e00eab\" id=\"ub1e00eab\">假如你的程序名称为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1c76d85c\" id=\"u1c76d85c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6856b4d\" id=\"ud6856b4d\">PID_GUI_Tool</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5bd10e00\" id=\"u5bd10e00\">，程序入口文件为</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub57f7f3f\" id=\"ub57f7f3f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u148cdb3f\" id=\"u148cdb3f\">main.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9b116d6e\" id=\"u9b116d6e\">，则在入口文件同级目录创建一个</span><code data-lake-id=\"u307f5d5c\" id=\"u307f5d5c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u86d1a851\" id=\"u86d1a851\">package.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub1acdc51\" id=\"ub1acdc51\">，写入如下内容</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22package.py%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20PyInstaller.__main__%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85%E8%BF%9B%E5%8E%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%87%8F%E5%B0%91%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%8C%85%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%93%E7%A7%AF%5Cnexcluded_modules%20%3D%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22scipy%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22matplotlib%5C%22%2C%5Cn%5D%5Cn%5Cnappend_string%20%3D%20%5B%5D%5Cnfor%20mod%20in%20excluded_modules%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20append_string%20%2B%3D%20%5Bf'--exclude-module%3D%7Bmod%7D'%5D%5Cn%5CnPyInstaller.__main__.run(%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20'-y'%2C%20%20%23%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9Cdist%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9%E5%86%85%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%A2%E9%97%AE%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20'-p'%2C%20'src'%2C%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%20Python%20%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%EF%BC%88%E5%